This project configures and extends LiteLLM (https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm),
which is installed from PyPI at the hash-pinned version in requirements.txt and is
not redistributed here. LiteLLM is licensed under the MIT License by its authors.

The custom providers in gateway/ call the Claude Code CLI (claude) and the Codex
CLI (codex exec), which each user installs and signs in to separately under their
own terms. Nothing here grants access to either service.
